msgid "Implementation complete · production acceptance gated"
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-ecapla-certverify-admin.php:1012
msgid "Standalone Program administration is implemented in the normalized domain and remains acceptance-gated. Certloom will not emulate Program relationships inside legacy custom fields."
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-ecapla-certverify-admin.php:1017
msgid "Pro commercial core · implementation gated"
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-ecapla-certverify-admin.php:1018
msgid "Versioned Templates, immutable revisions, six factory design families, deterministic assignments, lifecycle controls, canonical Render Plan Preview, and DSN-01/DSN-02/DSN-03 Designer foundations are implemented. Designer edits the same certloom-layout revision model with A4/Letter geometry, drag/resize/rotate, bounded undo/redo, snapping, alignment, layers, personal locks, secure element creation/removal, merge fields, local Media Library assets, QR, shapes and lines; it does not create another layout engine. Seal/background authoring map to existing image/shape primitives, while barcode storage remains deferred to the versioned DSN-05 schema upgrader. Publication and exact artifact-authoritative typography remain fail-closed behind renderer release authority; DSN-04 typography/styling is next."
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-ecapla-certverify-admin.php:1019
msgid "DSN-03 Designer elements/content implemented · publication/artifact authority gated · DSN-04 next"
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-ecapla-certverify-admin.php:1023
msgid "Planned issuance workflow"
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-ecapla-certverify-admin.php:1024
msgid "Manual and bulk issuance will use immutable Credential Versions, server-authoritative artifacts, reviewed eligibility and durable jobs. Template assignment now has a published-only resolution boundary so a newer draft cannot silently become issued output. The current registry editor remains the safe live write path until issuance dependencies are accepted."
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-ecapla-certverify-admin.php:1025
